  // luminosity(threshold 0.05) → bloom(strength 1.25) over this (MainRenderer),
  // and additive blending is SRC_ALPHA×ONE with an unpremultiplied source, so the
  // framebuffer receives col·alpha² — gains here land closer to squared than
  // linear. Anything generous whites out the whole frame for the flash's length.
